[02:18.17] Ticking away the moments that make up a dull day
[02:25.32] You fritter and waste the hours in an offhand way
[02:31.31] 
[02:33.05] Kicking around on a piece of ground in your hometown
[02:40.04] Waiting for someone or something to show you the way
[02:47.33] Tired of lying in the sunshine
[02:51.20] Staying home to watch the rain
[02:54.88] And you are young and life is long
[02:58.62] And there is time to kill today
[03:03.00] And then one day you find
[03:06.62] Ten years have got behind you
[03:10.19] No one told you when to run
[03:13.96] You missed the starting gun
[03:18.95] 
[04:43.78] And you run, and you run to catch up with the sun
[04:47.48] But it's sinking
[04:51.79] Racing around to come up behind you again
[04:57.41] 
[04:58.82] The sun is the same in a relative way
[05:02.03] But you're older
[05:05.95] Shorter of breath, and one day closer to death
[05:13.18] Every year is getting shorter
[05:16.68] Never seem to find the time
[05:20.34] Plans that either come to naught
[05:24.04] Or half a page of scribbled lines
[05:27.90] Hanging on in quiet desperation
[05:33.03] Is the English way
[05:35.66] The time is gone, the song is over
[05:39.34] Thought I'd something more to say
[05:44.51] 
[06:00.10] Home, home again
[06:05.49] 
[06:07.67] I like to be here when I can
[06:13.07] 
[06:15.19] When I come home cold and tired
[06:22.66] It's good to warm my bones beside the fire
